# Database Design

## Purpose

This document defines the logical data model for the HRMS platform.

The design will progress from business entities to relationships, then attributes, and finally the physical PostgreSQL schema.

---

# 1. Business Entities

The HRMS database consists of the following primary business entities.

## Organization

- Company
- Business Unit
- Department
- Designation
- Location

## Employee Management

- Employee
- Employee Document
- Employment History
- Emergency Contact

## Attendance

- Shift
- Attendance Record
- Attendance Regularization

## Leave

- Leave Type
- Leave Balance
- Leave Request
- Holiday Calendar

## Recruitment

- Job Opening
- Candidate
- Interview
- Interview Feedback

## Offer Management

- Offer
- Offer Approval

## Security

- User
- Role
- Permission

## Communication

- Notification
- Email Queue

## System

- Audit Log
- System Configuration

